      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Human purin metabolism is summarized briefly and the terms primary and secondary gout are defined. Asymptomatic hyperuricemia as a risk factor for gout, urate nephropathy and ischemic heart disease is discussed. Treatment modalities of hyperuricemia are presented."},
